WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.230 --> 00:00:13.960
84. The plane of jars. Laos, or Lao PDR, is a calm green oasis between other bigger,

2
00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:20.760
faster, and stronger nations. Near the center of this quiet country is a quiet mystery,

3
00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:27.640
the beautiful, unexplainable plane of jars. The plane of jars refers to more than 90 areas

4
00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:34.040
within Laos' Xian Quang Province. The sites are mostly the same. There are the green rolling

5
00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:40.140
hills of Lao, there are mountains in the distance, in the fields sunk into the grass or tipped

6
00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:46.420
onto their sides are many giant jars. The jars seem to have lids, though the lids have

7
00:00:46.420 --> 00:00:52.100
all disappeared over the centuries. There are also a few flat stone plates carved with

8
00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:58.760
animals. Why were large, heavy stone jars, some larger than a man and with thick, rough sides,

9
00:00:58.760 --> 00:01:05.060
scattered across the fields in this place? There are local legends and different scientific

10
00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:11.780
theories. Local legend holds that the jars stole Lao Lao, rice whiskey for a group of giants who

11
00:01:11.780 --> 00:01:18.600
